@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛跟着地图的指引，<br>来到了食堂。|#0101Adv08_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而食堂内的少女们<br>都已经开始用餐了。|#0101Adv08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……|#0101Adv08_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛四周观察着。<br>刚刚的事冲击太大，她现在脸色不是很好。<br>这时——|#0101Adv08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR5
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:喂～艾玛～！<br>过来这边！|#0101Adv08_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉兴冲冲地挥着小手，<br>喊艾玛过去。|#0101Adv08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊，原来这里是自由就座啊）|#0101Adv08_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走到雪莉她们的餐桌前，<br>拉开椅子坐了下来。|#0101Adv08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:刚刚表明了团结意向的雪莉、汉娜和梅露露也都在。<br>而餐盘上已经盛好了食物。|#0101Adv08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:这边用餐是自助餐形式，<br>所以你的份我也帮你取好了！|#0101Adv08_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,

[PrintTextModified Text:谢、谢谢你。|#0101Adv08_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚道完谢，她的嘴角却有些抽动。|#0101Adv08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:餐盘盛放的食物看起来黏糊糊的，颜色也十分诡异。<br>根本看不出这是哪样食物。|#0101Adv08_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……她们没有故意霸凌我吧？）|#0101Adv08_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉、汉娜和梅露露的餐盘上的，<br>还有取餐处盛放的，<br>都是这种令人恶心的饭菜。|#0101Adv08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那就是说，<br>　这座监牢的饭菜都是这么糟糕……）|#0101Adv08_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:不过她看到，饭菜中还是有完整的一颗苹果。<br>艾玛松了口气。|#0101Adv08_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR14

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然看起来不太妙，不过味道还是不错的哦！|#0101Adv08_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:你的舌头是不是坏掉了？<br>这个超级难吃的……|#0101Adv08_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……这些饭菜都是那些看守做的吧。|#0101Adv08_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想像了一下，<br>总感觉看守也是蛮可爱的耶。|#0101Adv08_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜无言望着雪莉。<br>她很怀疑雪莉，不止是舌头，连脑子也是坏掉的。|#0101Adv08_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:说到看守……<br>我刚刚碰见有看守<br>把亚里沙抓走了……|#0101Adv08_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我也看到了……不知道发生什么事了……<br>呜呜，好担心她……|#0101Adv08_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:刚刚她还气势汹汹地说“我要逃出去”呢，<br>应该是真的在想办法逃跑吧？|#0101Adv08_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:如果在禁止时间内被发现人在外面，<br>应该就会被带到<br>那个所谓的惩罚室吧……|#0101Adv08_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:惩罚室……究竟会有什么惩罚呢。|#0101Adv08_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不知是不是都想到了可怕的事情，<br>所有人都低着头，一言不发。|#0101Adv08_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:除了诺亚和亚里沙，所有人都在食堂里了。<br>在场的人看来都选择老实遵守规定行动。|#0101Adv08_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

