[PrintTextModified Text:离艾玛一桌稍远处，<br>蕾雅一众也在用餐。|#0101Adv08_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.4 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1 SubId:Front
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:这时艾玛和蕾雅的眼神对上了。<br>蕾雅抛出了一个微笑，<br>害得艾玛脸上热乎乎的，慌忙移开了视线。|#0101Adv08_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

