@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜看到了两人的互动后，<br>便把脸凑到艾玛旁边。|#0101Adv08_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:那个女人……<br>刚刚肯定在用魔法。|#0101Adv08_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:魔法……？|#0101Adv08_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的脸一下子僵住了。|#0101Adv08_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（刚刚梅露露还有诺亚<br>　都做出了超乎想像的事情。<br>　这些都是很普通的事情吗……？）|#0101Adv08_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:竟然使出诱惑女孩子的魔法……<br>而且还仗着自己是艺人，搞什么小团体，真叫人生气！|#0101Adv08_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看样子，汉娜十分看不惯蕾雅。<br>她一边生气，一边一口口把神秘饭菜往嘴里送。|#0101Adv08_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然她操着大小姐的口吻，<br>可用餐的方式却有些粗鲁。|#0101Adv08_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR17

[PrintTextModified Text:说到魔法，梅露露的魔法<br>真厉害呀！|#0101Adv08_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，现实中竟然真的有魔法，<br>真是吓了我一跳！|#0101Adv08_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:哇、哇哇哇……说、说太过了啦……|#0101Adv08_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在艾玛旁边安安分分用餐的梅露露<br>突然被拉进了对话，她一下子就羞得不行。|#0101Adv08_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:也没做，很厉害的事情……<br>只是帮艾玛小姐，止了血而已。|#0101Adv08_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ShowToastUI Text:"魔女图鉴 更新…|#Toast_001|"
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Meruru Category:Profile Version:2

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露满脸通红低下了头。<br>艾玛感觉自己想要说些什么，不由自主地站起身来。|#0101Adv08_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都在理所当然地聊什么魔法……<br>我想问，被抓进来的大家是不是都会魔法？|#0101Adv08_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是我根本就不会使用魔法……|#0101Adv08_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR12

[PrintTextModified Text:我和艾玛一样哦。<br>我也是刚知道有魔法这回事，也不会用。|#0101Adv08_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……哈啊，看来你们两个<br>是真的什么都不知道呢。|#0101Adv08_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜放下汤匙，夸张地叹了一口气。|#0101Adv08_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拥有魔女因子的人，可以使用神奇的力量哦。<br>那就是【魔法】。|#0101Adv08_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是你们没有发现，<br>自己其实也会用某些神奇的能力而已。|#0101Adv08_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～？我可没有什么<br>神奇能力耶？不过特技倒是有一样。|#0101Adv08_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉拿起眼前的苹果。|#0101Adv08_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

