[PrintTextModified Text:然后便轻易地单手把它捏碎了。|#0101Adv08_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她看起来不像有使出手指的力量，<br>可是苹果却碎得一干二净。<br>溅出的果汁把周围都弄脏了。|#0101Adv08_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0
