[PrintTextModified Text:啊……啊……|#0101Adv08_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是力气稍微有点大而已啦。|#0101Adv08_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜和艾玛都哑口无言了。|#0101Adv08_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

