@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Flushed1,ArmR7,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉瞪大眼睛愣了一下，<br>然后摆出羞涩的微笑。|#0101Adv08_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗……原来我会用魔法啊。<br>哎呀，好羞人耶～|#0101Adv08_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ShowToastUI Text:"魔女图鉴 更新…|#Toast_001|"
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Sherry Category:Profile Version:2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我才不信你真的从来都没发现呢……|#0101Adv08_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:那，汉娜你会什么魔法呢？|#0101Adv08_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:听到雪莉提问，<br>汉娜一脸得意地站起身来。|#0101Adv08_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真拿你没办法。这么想看的话<br>本小姐就表演给你看咯？看好咯？|#0101Adv08_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后汉娜走到显眼处，<br>忽然张开了双手——|#0101Adv08_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是我的魔法哇哇哇～|#0101Adv08_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hanna Loop:false ScenePositionY:70|65|70 Duration:1|0.5|3

[PrintTextModified Text:然后飘起来了，一点点。|#0101Adv08_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……大概有10厘米左右。<br>她的脚已经离开地面，像气球一样飘着。|#0101Adv08_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1,ArmR8,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:好厉害好厉害好厉害～！|#0101Adv08_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉满脸写着兴奋，<br>而汉娜的呼吸却渐渐变得紊乱，脸也变得愈来愈红。|#0101Adv08_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hanna Loop:false ScenePositionX:30|50|70 Duration:1|0.5|3

[PrintTextModified Text:我还可以一边飞一边移动！|#0101Adv08_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后移动了，一点点。<br>只有雪莉送去了掌声和欢呼。|#0101Adv08_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hanna Loop:false ScenePositionX:70 ScenePositionY:50

