[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，有可能。<br>毕竟也不知道所谓的检查是什么时候做的。|#0101Adv08_Hanna019| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜有些不甘心地咬着指甲。|#0101Adv08_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我本来是不想被关进监牢，<br>才一直以来都隐瞒了这份能力……|#0101Adv08_Hanna020| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:关进这种地方，接下来究竟<br>会变成什么样……|#0101Adv08_Hanna021| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的自言自语，<br>让现场的空气变得十分凝重。|#0101Adv08_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

